{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261105%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　法官譚耀豪<br/>黃之鋒認串謀勾結外國勢力｜判刑<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯被控謀殺等罪｜續審<br/>► 1000　34庭　法官郭啟安<br/>28歲男子被控謀殺女瑜伽導師｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　7庭　法官練錦鴻<br/>政府採購飲用水風波 涉案公司男董事被控欺詐等罪｜答辯<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官鍾明新<br/>元朗水蕉新村套丁案｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸觀塘法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官李志豪<br/>3女涉觀塘apm中庭打架｜答辯</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 0930　2庭　裁判官朱文瀚<br/>西九地盤奪命工業意外　工地「大判」、「二判」被控誤殺｜提訊日<br/>會計文員涉順利紀律部隊宿舍內非禮一女童及非法肛交｜提訊日</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:45:40.426607+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":400,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T15:32:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:38:17.398391+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:38:21.737113+00:00","content_hash":"14ecb5cc15eb43eb2bd2793534ae15860d8e803eb79e9ee098496425d10fab27","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}